type: software
title: "GraphChem: Graph-based machine learning for chemical property prediction"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python package for constructing graph neural network models that
  predict fuel properties from molecular structure (SMILES encoding, PyTorch
  Geometric datasets, MoleculeGCN, and bundled property datasets).
